        <mxCell id="scope-note" value="Source: OtpService.verify. Purpose dispatch alternatives are not sequential effects of one code: execute only the challenge matching the requested purpose. Failed attempts/locks and used-state rules are durable. A valid consumed code is single-use, not a command key whose repeated submission recreates the successful session." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
